; One storey, three rooms of a type carrying an invariant, a corridor of a type
; carrying none, and two zones — one with an area and one with no shape at all.
;
; Meeting Room B carries the width its type requires of every instance and
; Meeting Room A does not, which is the one failure in a model of several
; instances of the same type.
